#: ../../source/administration-guide/upgrade/upgrading-postgres.rst:138
msgid ""
"After upgrading PostgreSQL, run ``ANALYZE VERBOSE`` on the Mattermost "
"database. This re-populates the ``pg_statistics`` table used by "
"PostgreSQL to generate optimal query plans. Skipping this step can result"
" in degraded database performance."
